{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/MarketEventSymbols","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper class to compose and parse symbols for market events."}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:15DXFeedFramework18MarketEventSymbolsC","modules":[{"name":"DXFeedFramework"}],"title":"MarketEventSymbols","roleHeading":"Class","symbolKind":"class","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MarketEventSymbols"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"MarketEventSymbols","kind":"identifier"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"MarketEventSymbols","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Regional symbols"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Regional symbol subscription receives events only from a designated exchange, marketplace, or venue"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead of receiving composite events from all venues (by default). Regional symbol is composed from a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"base symbol, ampersand character (’&’), and an exchange code character. For example,","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“SPY” is the symbol for composite events for SPDR S&P 500 ETF from all exchanges,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"“SPY&N” is the symbol for event for SPDR S&P 500 ETF that originate only from NYSE marketplace."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Symbol attributes","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Market event symbols can have a number of attributes atta